        "flair_group_id": 41,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I&#39;ve heard of times when someone hit someone like Baron blade and he was able to reassign some of the dice, and he incapped the person attacking him but because enough damage got through he was also incapped. I think it was ruled that way too but not sure where.</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
        "admin": false,
